<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsubsection"><a href="#A2.SS1.SSS4" title="In B.1 Four axes of quality ‣ Appendix B Instructions Given to Labelers for Evaluating Summaries ‣ Correcting Human Labels for Rater Effects in AI Evaluation: An Item Response Theory Approach" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">B.1.4 </span>Overall quality</span></a></li>
</ol></li>
</ol></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_appendix"><a href="#A3" title="In Correcting Human Labels for Rater Effects in AI Evaluation: An Item Response Theory Approach" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">C </span>Checks of IRT Assumptions</span></a>
<ol class="ltx_toclist ltx_toclist_appendix">
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#A3.SS1" title="In Appendix C Checks of IRT Assumptions ‣ Correcting Human Labels for Rater Effects in AI Evaluation: An Item Response Theory Approach" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">C.1 </span>Unidimensionality</span></a></li>
